@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template illustration — separate draft publication and actual-material identities
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
top to bottom direction
package "Presentation owner — illustrative types" {
 class ResumeDraft {
  -resumeId : ResumeId
  -version : RevisionId
  -selections : ConfirmedSelection
 }
 class PublishedResumeRevision <<immutable identity>> {
  +revisionId : RevisionId
  +sourceDraftVersion : RevisionId
 }
 ResumeDraft ..> PublishedResumeRevision : separate confirmed publication
}
package "Files owner" {
 class ArtifactReference {
  +artifactId : ArtifactId
  +provenance : SourceIdentity
  +availability : ActualAvailability
 }
}
package "Applications owner" {
 class SubmissionMaterialSet {
  +submissionId : SubmissionId
  +actualProvenance : MaterialManifest
 }
}
PublishedResumeRevision ..> ArtifactReference : protected reference when applicable
SubmissionMaterialSet ..> ArtifactReference : retained actual-material reference
note bottom of ArtifactReference
 Dashed links show reference/provenance meaning.
 No final cardinalities or database schema are selected.
 Actual materials are not a mutable live-view pointer.
end note
@enduml
